# night
:night
?if actions_left() == 3
  It is a little after ten, and the whole of the quarter is awake and listening, behind shutters, in the heat.
?elif actions_left() == 2
  It is after one. There are lights in every window of the Hôtel de Ville, and a sound, a long way off, of drums, going round and round a square.
?else
  It is three. The stars are going out one by one over the rue de Vaugirard, and the cocks have begun in the yards. There is one thing more that you can do before the day.
?end
